-### Parameters
-*   **Grid Resolution ($D$):** Default $D = 400$ [S1].
-*   **Samples per Ray ($N$):** Suggested values $N = 600$ or $N = 800$ [S1].
-*   **Batch Size:** Default 1024 rays per training step [S1].
-*   **Training Steps:** Evaluated up to 512,000 steps [S1].
